    "chunk_text": "se wealdgenga, sy\u00fe\u00fean he \u00feas word gehirde, & aleat to eor\u00f0an mid eallum lichaman & \u00dea swor se apostol, \u00fe\u00e6t he so\u00f0lice wolde him mildsunge begitan \u00e6t \u00feam mildheortan H\u00e6lende, & eac He hine frefrode eac mid his f\u00e6geran lare & his afyrhte mod swi\u00fee f\u00e6gerlice mid his frofre He hine hadode eac to \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes \u00feeowdome; ac us ne seg\u00f0 na seo racu to hwam he hine sette, Amen. We habba\u00f0 nu ges\u00e6d be \u00f0am circlicum bocum on \u00fe\u00e6re ealdan \u00e6 & eac on \u00feare niwan: \u00f0a synd \u00fea Mid his wuldre ys afylled eall eor\u00f0an bradnysse. \u00d0a twa seraphin so\u00f0lice getacnodon \u00fea ealdan geky\u00f0nysse & eac \u00fea niwan, \u00fee heria\u00f0 mid wordum & \u00d0a lareowas, \u00fee nella\u00f0 heora lare nyman of \u00feisum halgum bocum, ne heora gebysnunga, \u00fea beo\u00f0 Gif se blinda man bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s blindan latteow, \u00feonne befealla\u00f0 hi begen on sumne blindne sea\u00f0. \u00d0a lareowas \u00fee willa\u00f0 heora lare nyman of \u00feisum halgum bocum & heora gebysnunga ge of \u00fe\u00e6re Twa & hundseofontig boca sind on bibliothecan, for \u00fean \u00fee hig sume sind tosette on twa for heora & swa fela \u00feeoda wurdon tod\u00e6lede \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re wundorlican byrig, \u00fee \u00fea entas woldon wircean mid And swa fela leorningcnihta asende ure H\u00e6lend mancinne to bodienne \u00fe\u00e6ra boca lare mid",
